  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/291/7.png\" alt=\"ariose\" width=\"1023\" height=\"71\"></h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"394\" height=\"115\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">加入我们的 Discord 服务器！获取专属技术支持与更新通知。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：本模组需要：</span> <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Create 模组 &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/796/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">现已发布全新更新 173.46.45</span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1546/451/well_1-png.png\" alt=\"well\" width=\"910\" height=\"460\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1546/450/monster_room_1_optimized-png.png\" alt=\"room\" width=\"1843\" height=\"1150\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在此下载：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Create 模组&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></a></h2>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">下载我们全新的 Create 模组！</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1082/284/256/256/638622594266642731.png\" alt=\"logo2\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-sky-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Sky Village</a> &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1082/284/256/256/638622594266642731.png\" alt=\"logo1\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">在此查看 Create 的开发状态。从这里你可以看到我们何时也会更新到更高的版本。</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1151/680/dev-png.png\" alt=\"create\" width=\"572\" height=\"1086\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">点击</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create/wiki/dev.status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">这里</span> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">查看官<strong>方的&nbsp;</strong>Create 开发状态！<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/796/638598725500886388.webp\" alt=\"create\" width=\"88\" height=\"88\"></span></a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">别忘了在我的主页查看我的其他模组！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/949/805/create-mod-minecraft.jpg\" alt=\"banner\" width=\"1200\" height=\"640\"></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/291/7.png\" alt=\"Create logo\" width=\"1023\" height=\"71\"></h2>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create: Structures Arise</strong> </span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">是一款 Forge 模组，它将 <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Create</strong></span> 模组令人惊叹的工程能力与散落在你的 Minecraft 世界中的动态自定义结构完美融合。本模组引入了由 Create 复杂机械系统驱动的复杂互动结构，将探索变成一场激动人心的冒险，自动化机器、谜题和机械奇观在每一个角落等待着你的发现。建造、探索并与这些高级结构互动，让你的游戏体验更上一层楼！</span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">关于 Create 模组的 Bug，请前往 Create 模组的官方页面反馈。<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://github.com/Creators-of-Create/Create/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create-Issues（问题反馈）</a></span></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/293/9.png\" alt=\"show\" width=\"1023\" height=\"172\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/733/minecraft__forge_1.png\" alt=\"create boat\" width=\"2175\" height=\"1082\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1432/101/line-png.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1280\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/290/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intell\" width=\"182\" height=\"182\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用 IntelliJ 开发</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">#广告</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">产品免责声明：非官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或微软批准，也不与其关联。</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
